WEBVTT

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:03.197
face-to-face contact with someone
without shying away

00:04:03.239 --> 00:04:04.532
for almost a minute.

00:04:05.074 --> 00:04:07.618
Through drawing, you slowed down,

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:09.537
you paid attention,

00:04:09.537 --> 00:04:12.081
you looked closely at someone

00:04:12.081 --> 00:04:14.917
and you let them look closely at you.

00:04:15.584 --> 00:04:16.794
Good job.

00:04:17.461 --> 00:04:19.547
I have found that drawing like this

00:04:19.588 --> 00:04:23.301
creates an immediate connection
like nothing else.

00:04:25.219 --> 00:04:26.387
Alright.

00:04:26.429 --> 00:04:31.809
So I call myself an illustrator
and a graphic journalist.